# S4: the G1 four-card defaults check: general-tp4-ring-mmrs (FABRIC_1D_RING and the fused prefill matmul + reduce-scatter on
# together, each of which has run alone) through the API smoke with the token-agreement test, and a short decode bench. If it
# passes, both become the general-tp4 family's defaults. Compare afterwards: agreement with python3 scripts/ci/tp_agreement.py
# compare agreement-general-tp4.json agreement-general-tp4-ring-mmrs.json (the earlier run's file first; NOT_COMPARABLE if a
# prompt file changed since); the bench against the earlier medians at the same shapes (per user, tok/s: 1x4096 32.5, 1x32768
# 31.6, 4x4096 28.9, 4x32768 26.8, 8x4096 29.1, FABRIC_1D and the fused prefill off) and the fused-prefill arm's 8k first-token time.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card S2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/s2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by whoever drives
# the window (the graft directory and the graft binary digest of the one-card harnesses); every other value is final.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image S0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; ready 3-7 min (the four-card cache exists); warmup, coding, long_real_text and concurrent4 6-12
# min; agreement 5-10 min; the bench (five shapes, every prefill serial) 8-15 min: 25-45 min in all (step limit 210 min).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-s2-1
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4-ring-mmrs
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,agreement,bench
C2_BENCH_SHAPES=1x4096,1x32768,4x4096,4x32768,8x4096
